theorem OAI.SecondPassArithmetic.firstTail_scalar_bound (K D E U₁ U₂ lengthScale B G₁ G₂ P H:ℝ) (A:ℕ)
    (hK:0<K) (hD:0<D) (hE:0<E) (hU₁:0<U₁) (hU₂:0<U₂)
    (hL:0≤lengthScale) (hG₁:0≤G₁) (hG₂:0≤G₂) (hP:0≤P) (hH:0≤H)
    (hDb:D≤lengthScale*B^2) (hEb:E≤B^2) (hU₁b:U₁≤lengthScale) (hU₂b:U₂≤lengthScale):
    (128*U₁)*(128*U₂)*(G₁*G₂*K)*
      (P/((min 1 (K/(D*E*U₁*U₂)))^2*(1+H)^A))≤
    (128*lengthScale)^2*(G₁*G₂*K)*P*(1+lengthScale^3*B^4/K)^2/(1+H)^A := by sorry
